Z||000000||lennyb4||02-09-2000||08:29 AM||||Just a quick question. I was thinking about making a radio housing face, shift plate w/shift arm tracks, and gauge facing out of billet alum. My question would be if anyone has heard of someone doing this before either for personnel use or for resale? I really think it would spruce up the interior of my fiero.||||reg||10
Z||000001||william_thorniii||02-09-2000||10:40 AM||||Lenny,<P>Jr. in FL makes a billet dash kit.  If you do a search in this forum for GA upgrade kits I am sure that you will find his address.  Also I remember that it is something like <A HREF="http://www.jrisagod@..." TARGET=_blank>www.jrisagod@...</A>  or <A HREF="http://www.jrsagod@..." TARGET=_blank>www.jrsagod@...</A>  if that helps.  I would hold off, I know that a Forum member is working on a cheap alternative that will look as good at point of purchase and much better with aging.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
