Z||000006||william_thorniii||02-09-2000||06:00 PM||||Lenny,<P>Your plan is very similar to what I was going to try a while ago.  Keep me informed, I am interested in your progress.  Are you intending to completely replace the face plates or simply machine out the required holes and then bond them to the existing plates?  The kits that I have seen all bond in place.  The metals (at least JR's) I look bad with edges exposed.  I am just trying to give you food for thought.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||3
