Z||000013||lennyb4||02-10-2000||08:43 AM||||Gentlemen,<P> Theres alot more comments then what i expected here.I am planning on machining the entire plates (radio facia, Gage facing, Rally gage face, Shift plate w/guides) and counter sinking the mounting holes just like the originals. They will be full replacements not stick ons. 6061 AL is show quailty material which i will buff & polish to a mirror like finish. The edge's will be milled smooth and possiblly even tapered (1/4 round). I'll keep you all posted as the project gets under way.||||reg||14
Z||000014||lennyb4||02-10-2000||09:27 AM||||Food for thought. I was talking to a friend who works for BMW this morning. He introduced me to a place where i can get the same typr of stainless steel the BMW uses for about the same price as AL. So i think i'll go with the surgical stainless(more show quality). I'll start my project in about one week and keep you all informed.||||reg||6
